елни и обществени събития, насочени към развитие на местната общност, съхраняване на традициите и подпомагане на гражданската активност. Отчетът осигурява прозрачност, отговорност и ясна представа за развитието на организацията през отчетния период." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="org.chyavorec.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[189,1458][810,1671]" /><node index="3" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="org.chyavorec.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[865,1212][1027,1374]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="org.chyavorec.app" content-desc="Отвори с приложение за PDF" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[905,1252][986,1333]" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="org.chyavorec.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[878,1225][1013,1360]" /></node></node><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="org.chyavorec.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,1711][1080,2177]"><node index="0" text="Учредителни документи · 30.04.2026 · 988.2 Kb" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="org.chyavorec.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[189,1752][810,1860]" /><node index="1" text="Устав" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="org.chyavorec.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[189,1860][365,1924]" /><node index="2" text="Уставът представлява основният вътрешен документ, който определя целите, структурата, управлението и правилата на организацията. Той описва начина на вземане на решения, правата и задълженията на членовете, органите на управление, реда за провеждане на събрания, финансовите принципи и всички основни норми, по които институцията функционира. Уставът гарантира прозрачност, законност и последователност в дейността на организацията и служи като официална рамка за нейното управление." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="org.chyavorec.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[189,1924][810,2137]" /><node index="3" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="org.chyavorec.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[865,1753][1027,1915]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="org.chyavorec.app" content-desc="Отвори с приложение за PDF" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="